{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Wow, where did you get all that food? ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^They come from above. From my gods. Nom Nom. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Your gods? ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^They fall from the top of the sea...I think they’re sent just for me. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Nom nom nom. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Meow, I don’t think those are from gods... ","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","\n","^What are you talking about! ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Where else would they come from??  ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^I’m waiting for more right now... ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Meow, alright for some. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^I have to eat scraps from behind the bins. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Bleh bin scraps. ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^So you have never been given something from the sky? ","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^No. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^There is this girl, she feeds me nice things... ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^but she’s not a god. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^Do her gifts come from above? Nom.","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^I mean technically...she is much taller than me. ","#","^speaker: Bobby","/#","\n","^See!!","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^You’re silly, meow. ","#","^speaker: Bobby ","/#","#","^mood: Begging","/#","\n","^Whatever, leave me alone now.","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^You’ll make me miss the next gift!!","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n","^Nom nom.","#","^speaker: Starfish","/#","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}